<title>INDIA: Indian crude and petroleum output falls in February.</title>
<headline>Indian crude and petroleum output falls in February.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's crude petroleum production fell to 2.45 million tonnes in February from 2.65 million in the same month last year, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>    PETROLEUM OUTPUT     Feb 97    Feb 96	 Apr-Feb</p>
<p>							  1996/97  1995/96</p>
<p>    Crude		    2,450     2,645    28,754     31,710</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products   5,007     4,611    57,269     53,497</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. Figures for petroleum products relate to throughput.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
